tools.description:
Natural-language search (NLWeb /ask) over Agent Ready's own content — scoring methodology, the check registry, the specs it validates, and the content library (explainers, comparisons, how-to guides, glossary). Returns Schema.org-typed result objects. Optional itemType narrows to a corpus type; mode 'summarize' adds an extractive summary.

```ts
mcp__Agent_Ready__ask(args: {
// Natural-language question to search Agent Ready's docs, scoring methodology, check registry, and content library (explainers, comparisons, how-to guides, glossary).
q: string, // minLength: 1, maxLength: 2000
// Restrict results to a content type: methodology, checks, specs, llms-txt, check, page (explainers/guides/glossary), or any (default: all types).
itemType?: "methodology" | "checks" | "specs" | "llms-txt" | "check" | "page" | "any",
// "list" (default) returns matching items; "summarize" returns a synthesized answer.
mode?: "list" | "summarize",
}): Promise<{
// Matching result items (Schema.org-typed).
results: { name?: string | null, url?: string | null, description?: string | null, [key: string]: any }[],
// Extractive summary when mode is 'summarize'.
message?: string | null,
}>;
```

Scans a public website for how readable it is to AI agents and crawlers, returning a 0–100 Vercel agent-readability score, an llms.txt score, and a per-check breakdown with fixes. Renders an interactive score card. Most scans finish in under a minute; a slow scan returns a scan id you can re-check with get_scan.

```ts
mcp__Agent_Ready__scan_site(args: {
url: string, // maxLength: 2000, format: "uri"
}): Promise<{ shareUrl: string | null, llmstxtScore: number | null, id: string, vercelRating: string | null, status: "running" | "completed" | "failed", pagesDiscovered: number, vercelScore: number | null, pagesScanned: number, pollUrl: string | null, checkGroups: { total: number, passed: number, category: string, checks: { name: string, checkId: string, message: string, howToFix: string | null, status: "pass" | "fail" | "warn" | "error" }[] }[], rootUrl: string }>;
```

Cancel one of your pending or in-progress tasks.

```ts
